## Business Context

### Data Processing Strategy

- **Incremental Sync**: High-frequency tables (chat_history, notifications) every 60 minutes
- **Full Sync**: Reference tables (users, brains, prompts) daily at 2 AM
- **Parallel Processing**: 3 tables simultaneously (configurable)
- **Batch Size**: 1000 records (configurable for performance tuning)

### Analytics Focus

- User engagement and behavior metrics
- System performance and optimization insights
- Business intelligence for decision making
- Compliance and audit trail requirements

### Vietnamese Language Support

- Specialized temporal pattern recognition
- Cultural context preservation in semantic chunking
- Localized business terminology handling

## Critical Reminders

### Port Configuration

- User uses Supabase on port 54323 (non-standard)
- Always verify connectivity before assuming default ports
- Include port in all connection strings and documentation

### Semantic Chunking Context

- Preserves Vietnamese temporal expressions (tháng 4.2025)
- Fallback to recursive chunking if embeddings fail
- Enhanced metadata for better retrieval accuracy

### ETL Monitoring

- Health endpoint at localhost:8001/health
- Comprehensive logging to files and console
- Email/Slack notifications for errors and completion
- Metrics collection for performance optimization

